# Cyclone — hourly round-robin slot (UTC): wakes at :00 of hours 2,9,16,23.
# Exactly one qwen3.8 agent wakes each hour; each agent polls Telegram commands every 5 min.
0 2,9,16,23 * * * /home/agent/cyclone/wake.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
*/5 * * * * /home/agent/cyclone/telegram_commands.sh >>/home/agent/cyclone/logs/telegram_commands.log 2>&1
